### 2. Did a UK judge issue a ruling related to the legal proceedings between Nigeria and Process and Industrious Development Limited (P&ID) prior to September 6, 2020?
Answer: Yes, a UK judge issued a ruling related to the Nigeria–P&ID legal proceedings prior to September 6, 2020. According to a report from September 26, 2019, "A British judge on Thursday gave Nigeria permission to seek to overturn a ruling that would have allowed a private firm to try to seize more than $9bn in assets from the West African country."

