Answer: The UK judge, Sir Ross Cranston, found that Vice President Yemi Osinbajo's interventions were "instrumental" in uncovering the P&ID fraud and that his June 2018 statement calling the deal "a fraud on the nation" turned the case in Nigeria's favour. The ruling also established that "a primary facie fraud case in the P&ID matter has been established," granting Nigeria's application for an extension of time and relief from sanctions.

Source URL: https://dailytrust.com/how-osinbajo-detected-pid-fraud-against-nigeria-uk-judge/

### 4. Did the Daily Trust report claim that the UK judge's ruling credited Nigerian Vice President Yemi Osinbajo with detecting or uncovering the P&ID fraud?
