Answer: Yes, the details are documented in publicly available, authoritative UK court records. The search result reports on a ruling by Sir Ross Cranston of the UK High Court of Justice Queen’s Bench Division Commercial Court, specifically citing excerpts from the judgment that detail Vice President Osinbajo's role and correspondence in the P&ID case.

